{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whispering Stacks is a cozy, rogue-lite side-scrolling zap-em-up where you play a wizard trying really hard to study at the library while its magical inhabitants do everything in their power to stop you</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zap your way through a randomly generated library full of magical foes, on your quest for arcane knowledge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect stylish outfits you totally didn't steal from a giant moth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your own cozy reading nook where you can relax after a long day of fighting mythical creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Befriend virtual companions and invite them to stay in your reading nook</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect mysterious artefacts like the Divination of Tranquility tarot deck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run in terror from the librarians</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3620260?t=1745573069","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620260/4ed70fd3c73f5aa5610e7c91d252403ba630462e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745573069","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620260/83fc27164b64e4424dd4f69c980960ecdcac7913/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745573069","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620260/83fc27164b64e4424dd4f69c980960ecdcac7913/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745573069","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whispering Stacks is a cozy, rogue-lite side-scrolling zap-em-up where you play a wizard trying really hard to study at the library while its magical inhabitants do e